    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106237" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγρο-κέλευθος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>having wet paths,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τηθύς, Νηρηΐδες,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				22.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰχθύες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.
					62
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leaving a moist trail,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοχλίας</span> Poet. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.63b
			</span></i>; so, perh., metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεφέλαι</span>”
